This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a mutation battery behind a shipped fixture: the battery behind `review-shard-merge`.
It edits copies of the distribution's own `partition-review-diff.sh` and `merge-review-shards.sh`,
which a consumer is denied editing, and its runtime is why the arms and the mutants are separate
directories. It sources `review-shard-merge/lib.sh`, so it scores the predicates the shipped arms run.
